									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Turn an empty patch of land into a colourful summer escape, one pool, path, and twisting slide at a time. <strong>Splash Park Tycoon</strong> puts you in charge of the fun and the everyday decisions that keep it running.</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Build your signature slide</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/874ee8d92711758cd2179f844ac93a61.poster.avif?t=1793138158" width=640 height=360 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/874ee8d92711758cd2179f844ac93a61.webm?t=1793138158" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/874ee8d92711758cd2179f844ac93a61.mp4?t=1793138158" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Design custom water slides piece by piece—combine drops, loops, tunnels, boosters, and helixes to the final splashdown.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Choose your colours, name your rides, and give each corner of the park its own personality.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Lay out pools, splash pads, lazy rivers, wave pools, and relaxing lounging areas.</p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" >Follow the splash</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/87a06866531626dae4f48397b097b10f.poster.avif?t=1793138158" width=640 height=360 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/87a06866531626dae4f48397b097b10f.webm?t=1793138158" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/87a06866531626dae4f48397b097b10f.mp4?t=1793138158" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Watch guests queue, climb the tower, and slide down your creations.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Hop into the <strong>ride camera</strong> to follow the action from a first-person splash perspective.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Cater to different visitor types, from fearless thrill-seekers to sunbathers and families.</p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" >Bring your park to life</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/2eeb8e9baa9ea3f6054c4a3e47b22bde.poster.avif?t=1793138158" width=640 height=360 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/2eeb8e9baa9ea3f6054c4a3e47b22bde.webm?t=1793138158" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/2eeb8e9baa9ea3f6054c4a3e47b22bde.mp4?t=1793138158" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Fill your pools with swimmers, floats, and playful pool toys.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Keep guests comfortable with drinks, food stalls, shade, restrooms, and scenic seating.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Decorate with palms, lighting, and themed props, watching the atmosphere transform from daytime bustle to evening lights.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Create evening fireworks and fountain shows for your guests.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Adapt to heat and changing weather with shade, shelter, and a well-kept park.</p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" >Make it thrive</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/69f23ce0450106a923b6a25cf940a588.poster.avif?t=1793138158" width=640 height=360 ><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/69f23ce0450106a923b6a25cf940a588.webm?t=1793138158" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5230000/extras/69f23ce0450106a923b6a25cf940a588.mp4?t=1793138158" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Set ticket prices, manage advertising campaigns, and balance income against construction, wages, and upkeep.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Hire and manage lifeguards, ride attendants, janitors, restockers, and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Research new attractions, earn stamps, and save your favourite layouts as reusable blueprints.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Build your reputation through word of mouth: guests remember high prices, broken rides, and great days out.</p></li></ul><h2 class="bb_tag" >Play your way</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Sandbox:</strong> Open your first pool, earn money from visitors, and expand at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Creative Lab:</strong> Experiment with unlimited funds and every ride unlocked from the start.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Challenges:</strong> Tackle tight budgets, opening-week targets, heat waves, and rainy seasons.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><i>The complete park-building and management game is 100% free. The optional <strong>Duck Club</strong> supporter pack adds cosmetic bonuses, with no gameplay restrictions or paywalls.</i></p>						</div>
					</div>
